      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Williams and the clinical team for their thorough exams, calm demeanor, and compassionate communication during routine visits and urgent appointments. However, two dissatisfied clients reported unhelpful interactions and felt their concerns were dismissed."
      }
    },
    {
