        "en": "Effective treatments and thorough diagnostics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers often describe successful treatments for skin allergies, dental cleanings, orthopedic consultations, and urgent injuries. While most pets experience marked improvement, two customers were frustrated by unclear diagnostic explanations and high charges for unresolved symptoms."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
