        "en": "Gentle handling during examinations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the gentle care shown to both dogs and cats during checkups and stressful appointments, noting thoughtful touches such as a quiet candle tribute during pet goodbyes. However, one owner reported significant distress in their cat following back-room testing."
      }
    }
